%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor': '#4F46E5'}}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as JWT Auth Middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>FE: Navigate to /projects/new
    activate FE

    User->>FE: Fill project form<br/>(name, description, platform,<br/>tech stack, complexity)
    FE->>FE: Validate form inputs client-side

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/projects<br/>Authorization: Bearer {access_token}<br/>Body: {name, description, target_users,<br/>platform, preferred_tech, constraints, complexity}
    activate API

    API->>Auth: get_current_user(credentials)
    activate Auth
    Auth->>Auth: Decode JWT token<br/>Verify HS256 signature<br/>Extract user_id from "sub" claim
    Auth->>DB: SELECT user WHERE id = :user_id AND is_active = true
    activate DB
    DB-->>Auth: User record
    deactivate DB
    Auth-->>API: User object
    deactivate Auth

    API->>API: Validate request body<br/>ProjectCreate schema validation

    API->>DB: INSERT INTO projects<br/>(owner_id, name, description, target_users,<br/>platform, preferred_tech, constraints,<br/>complexity, status='created',<br/>current_stage='requirements', progress=0)
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Project UUID
    deactivate DB

    loop For each of 14 workflow stages
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO project_stages<br/>(project_id, stage_name, status='pending')
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: Stage UUID
        deactivate DB
    end

    API->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    DB-->>API: Commit success
    deactivate DB

    API->>API: Refresh project with relationships
    API-->>FE: 201 Created<br/>ProjectResponse {id, name, status,<br/>current_stage, progress, ...}
    deactivate API

    FE->>FE: Store project data in state
    FE-->>User: Display project created confirmation<br/>Show project workspace
    deactivate FE

    Note over User,DB: Project created with 14 pending stages<br/>Ready for AI orchestration to begin

    User->>FE: Click "Start AI Workflow"
    activate FE
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/projects/{id}/orchestrate/start
    activate API
    API->>API: AIOrchestrator(db, project_id)
    API->>API: orchestrator.start_workflow()
    API->>DB: UPDATE projects SET status='in_progress'
    API-->>FE: 200 {status: "started"}
    deactivate API
    FE-->>User: Redirect to project workspace<br/>WebSocket connected for live updates
    deactivate FE
